no spare AVD existed to boot per the "spare AVDs untapped" playbook.

Polled `qa_lock_survey` every ~65s from 23:01:33 to 23:11:28 (+04, 2026-08-26)
— 10 consecutive polls, effective_capacity stayed 0 throughout. Per the
bounded-queue-wait rule (~60s polls up to 10 min) this QA pass reports
BLOCKED for every AC that requires a live UserApp instance (AC2, AC4, and
the "live" component of AC1/AC3) rather than spin further.

